OL,3,GNEWSACity centre shop siren goes silent
OL,4,Aafter 150 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA city centre siren which went off
OL,7,Fdaily at lunchtime for more than 150
OL,8,Fyears has sounded for the final time.
OL,10,FThe 13:00 time signal at HL Brown
OL,11,Fjewellers and watchmakers, on the
OL,12,Fcorner of Barker's Pool and Leopold
OL,13,FStreet in Sheffield, has been a daily
OL,14,Ftradition since 1874.
OL,16,FIt was originally created by the
OL,17,Ffounder of the company, Harris Brown,
OL,18,Fto show off that he was up to speed
OL,19,Fwith new technologies of the time. The
OL,20,Fsignal was received from Greenwich and
OL,21,Fallowed people to set their watches and
OL,22,Fclocks by it.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
