OL,3,GNEWSACity centre shop siren goes silent
OL,4,Aafter 150 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FLoupe Jewellers, who took over the
OL,7,Fbusiness in June, said: "After careful
OL,8,Fconsideration the building's iconic one
OL,9,Fo'clock siren was carefully removed and
OL,10,Fgifted to HL Brown."
